    dcterms:source "Ashlag, Petiḥa le-Ḥokhmat ha-Qabbala, §§1, 6, 32, 100 and 168, Hebrew text of the Jerusalem 1945 printing with the Sulam commentary on the Zohar as given in the Sefaria library (edition from Sefaria's version record; no title page in the text layer)", "Ashlag, Haqdama le-Sefer ha-Zohar, §§6 (ו), 58 (נח), 59 (נט), 60 (ס), 61 (סא) and 62 (סב), Hebrew text of the Sefaria library, version Baal HaSulam's Introduction to Zohar, ed. Zohar HaSulam, 2019 (edition from Sefaria's version record; no title page in the text layer)" .
